**Question description**
 After refreshing (press F5) a accessed page loaded by sendfile method in Browser, I can`t get any html document.,only a empty page showed.But if refreshing again or freshing ignoring cached content (Shift + F5),the page could be accessed.


**Code **

```go
package main

import "github.com/gofiber/fiber"


func main() {
	app := fiber.New()
        app.Get("/not-found", func(c *fiber.Ctx) {
		if err := c.SendFile("404.html"); err != nil {
		  c.Next(err) 
	
	  })
  
	app.Listen(3000)
  }
  
```
